{"id":"hinzu","lemma":"hinzu","pos":"adv","rank":4512,"glosses":["in addition, besides","on the way there"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/33/De-hinzu.ogg/De-hinzu.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Fügen Sie ein bisschen Milch hinzu.","en":"Add a little milk.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/392165","words":[{"g":"to join"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"bit"},{"g":"milk"},null]},{"text":"Fügt mehr Wasser hinzu!","en":"Add more water to it.","words":[{"g":"to join","l":"fügen"},{"g":"more"},{"g":"water"},null]},{"text":"Füge nicht zu viel Salz hinzu.","en":"Don't add too much salt.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/760507","words":[{"g":"to join","l":"fügen"},{"g":"not"},null,null,{"g":"salt, table salt, sal"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"too much"]]},{"text":"Tom kam erst viel später hinzu.","en":"Tom came along much later.","words":[null,{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},{"g":"first, at first"},{"g":"much, a lot"},{"g":"later"},null]},{"text":"Er fügte hinzu, dass er es nicht glaube.","en":"He added that he didn't believe it.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to join","l":"fügen"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to believe something","l":"glauben"}]}]}